<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="recommended-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_rogue_eviscerate.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Recommended Gear for Assassination Rogues in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-assassination-rogue-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="$color" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">What is the BiS Assassination Rogue gear?</span></h3>Targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list from the ideal Assassination  Rogue drops found in Phase 3 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be almost as good, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Assassination Rogues</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="thunderforging">
<span class="c4">Thunderforging</span></h3>Newly introduced with Throne of Thunder is Thunderforging. When a piece of gear is randomly Thunderforged, its iLvl is increased by 6. Blizzard is also giving us the option to take non-tier raid gear that isn't Thunderforged and upgrade them using <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, so that they're equivalent iLvl to a piece that is Thunderforged. The list below is of items that when fully Thunderforged, are BiS. Everyone will likely be experiencing a different path to their own BiS this tier, so it's important to utilize sims to assist you in knowing what is or isn't an upgrade!<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
