<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Assassination Rogues in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></span></h2>The set bonuses in Phase 3 are a bit more intriguing than the past tier. Our two-set treats our duration finishers as if we spent an additional combo point, up to 6 combo points! This will result in longer Ruptures and Slice and Dices, allowing us to cast more Eviscerates. Our four set isn't as interesting, but it is incredibly powerful. During Shadow Blades, our abilities will cost 15% less energy. Additionally, though it isn't mentioned, our 4-set bonus will grant us a 0.3 GCD reduction during the duration of Shadow Blades.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
