<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Best Assassination Rogue Trinkets in Phase 3</span></span></h2>While our absolute BiS trinkets are very easy to figure out and set in stone, it may be hard to acquire both of these or you may not have the profession mandatory for them. For this reason, we'll list both the best trinkets and a couple of alternatives that you can aim for while waiting for drops to happen.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>The best trinkets are generally the ones that best align with your big DPS cooldowns.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96369/renatakis-soul-charm">
<img alt="Renataki's Soul Charm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_bladestorm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Renataki's Soul Charm</span></a> is our best trinket option that provides a generous amount of Agility over 10 seconds.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94511/vicious-talisman-of-the-shado-pan-assault">
<img alt="Vicious Talisman of the Shado-Pan Assault" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_speedoflight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Talisman of the Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> is quite the contender for how easy it is to acquire. With a large chunk of hit and a gigantic burst of Agility, it's no surprise this trinket competes with the best.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96409/bad-juju">
<img alt="Bad Juju" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_troll_voodoodoll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bad Juju</span></a> gives you a large burst of Agility with a silly proc of summoning 3 voodoo gnomes! Uniquely, Assassination Rogues will choose to pass on this trinket in favor of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94511/vicious-talisman-of-the-shado-pan-assault">
<img alt="Vicious Talisman of the Shado-Pan Assault" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_speedoflight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Talisman of the Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> as the proc doesn't line up well with <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=79140/vendetta">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_deadliness.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vendetta</span></a>.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Reputation for Assassination Rogues in Phase 3</span></span></h2>Reputation gear can be quite potent, and this continues to be true heading into Phase 3. With the arrival of the new faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>, you'll gain reputation for clearing bosses in Throne of Thunder. Here you'll receive iLvl 522 pieces that are quite powerful and will hold you off until you replace them with Heroic gear.<br/>
<br/>Also new in Phase 3 will be the factions <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor Offensive</span></a> for <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span> &amp; <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1388/sunreaver-onslaught">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Onslaught</span></a> for <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>. The iLvl of these rewards ranges from 496 down to 476. Unfortunately, they'll be relegated to transmog once Celestials arrive.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
